in. Could choose Candidate D as provisional because strengths and less known negative behavior? D has responsibility, concentration, problem solving, and no explicit negative crew cooperation evidence (just moody/loner). A is unfriendly, unhealthy; B has clear negative crew behavior; C has communication issues and egocentric. D seems relatively balanced though lacking crew cooperation evidence. So provisional vote for D, with note that we need more evidence.\n\nThus public message: propose provisional vote for D, but highlight need for crew cooperation and communication evidence for A, C, D, plus reliability and stress resilience for A, C, D.\n\nLet's craft."}
